{"id":"d206adde37fe6db8","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-diagonal-pair-universal.md","title":"对角不可分对接收所有不交 c.e. 对","display":"thm-diagonal-pair-universal — 对角不可分对接收所有不交 c.e. 对","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-diagonal-pair-universal","aliases":["20-thm-diagonal-pair-universal"],"display":"thm-diagonal-pair-universal — 对角不可分对接收所有不交 c.e. 对","chapter":"2","section":"2.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.4.18 的对角对特例","source_printed_pages":[42],"source_pdf_pages":[78],"depends_on":["[[20-df-pair-reducibility]]","[[20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-lem-padding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-diagonal-pair-universal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-diagonal-pair-universal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-diagonal-pair-universal — 对角不可分对接收所有不交 c.e. 对"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.4.18 的对角对特例"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>42</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>78</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2a1bca4da285ab7f\" href=\"?note=2a1bca4da285ab7f\" title=\"20-df-pair-reducibility\">20-df-pair-reducibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f6ed68c536ba88e\" href=\"?note=4f6ed68c536ba88e\" title=\"20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable\">20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_0,B_1\\in\\mathcal E\">\\(B_0,B_1\\in\\mathcal E\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_0\\cap B_1=\\varnothing\">\\(B_0\\cap B_1=\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=i\\}\">\\(A_i=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=i\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;2\">\\(i&lt;2\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2a1bca4da285ab7f\" href=\"?note=2a1bca4da285ab7f\" title=\"20-df-pair-reducibility\">20-df-pair-reducibility</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4f6ed68c536ba88e\" href=\"?note=4f6ed68c536ba88e\" title=\"20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable\">20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}pair\\text{-}universal}\\vdash\n(B_0,B_1)\\le_1(A_0,A_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}pair\\text{-}universal}\\vdash\n(B_0,B_1)\\le_1(A_0,A_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对 z 编译忽略输入的程序：等 z 进入 B₀ 则输出 0，等进入 B₁ 则输出 1，否则一直等。s-m-n 与 padding 给单射 f(z)。故 z∈B_i 当且仅当 φ_f(z)(f(z))=i；z 不在两源列中时整程序发散，目标也不在 A₀∪A₁。此处仅证明对角对的特例，不把它冒充一般 Smullyan 对归约定理。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.4.18 的对角对特例；印刷页 42；PDF 第 78 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-pair-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"2a1bca4da285ab7f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pair-reducibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable","status":"resolved","id":"4f6ed68c536ba88e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-padding]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pair-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"2a1bca4da285ab7f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pair-reducibility]]；see [[20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable","status":"resolved","id":"4f6ed68c536ba88e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pair-reducibility]]；see [[20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pair-reducibility]]；see [[20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-padding","status":"resolved","id":"743a0376168bb7ec","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pair-reducibility]]；see [[20-ex-diagonal-effective-inseparable]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B_0,B_1\\in\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"B_0\\cap B_1=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"A_i=\\{e:\\varphi_e(e)\\downarrow=i\\}","display":false},{"tex":"i<2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}diagonal\\text{-}pair\\text{-}universal}\\vdash\n(B_0,B_1)\\le_1(A_0,A_1).","display":true}],"bytes":1541,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["2a1bca4da285ab7f","4f6ed68c536ba88e","8ba6597a854c206f","743a0376168bb7ec"]}